        "approval_date": "4th July 2025",
        "version": null,
        "text": "Working Visas\n(4)\nThe choice of visa will be dependent on the activities being undertaken, whether any remuneration is paid and the length of the stay. People & Culture will work with their nominated Immigration Lawyer to establish the most appropriate visa for the position.\n(5)\nPeople & Culture will work with individuals to determine their current working rights in Australia."
    },
